# landing_dead_zone.scn — a soft ToF landing with the sensor's close-range dead zone modelled
#                         センサの近距離の不感帯を模擬した、柔らかい接地の ToF 着陸
#
# Spec: in ALT_HOLD/POS_HOLD a pilot DISARM must NOT cut the
# motors mid-air (the craft would drop). Instead it starts an AUTO-LANDING — a gradual
# descent (computeLanding, ~0.3 m/s) — and touchdown does the real DISARM (LANDING →
# IDLE_GROUND). ACRO/STABILIZE and the ground states still cut immediately, and a DISARM
# pressed AGAIN while landing is the emergency cut.
#   C/D: ARM in ALT_HOLD → auto-takeoff → hover at 0.5 m.
#   F:   press DISARM while FLYING → auto-land. Motors keep running through a gradual
#        descent (duty > 0.3), then touchdown DISARMs. NOT an instant motor cut / drop.
#
# 仕様: ALT_HOLD/POS_HOLD のパイロット DISARM は空中でモータを
# 切ってはならない（落下する）。代わりに自動着陸（緩降下 ~0.3 m/s）を起動し、接地で本当の
# DISARM（LANDING→IDLE_GROUND）。ACRO/STABILIZE・地上は即停止のまま、着陸中の再 DISARM は緊急カット。
#
# alt_disarm_land.scn with the ToF close-range dead zone modelled (the default of a run; the real
# sensor reads "no target" below ~3 cm, so it is invalid on the floor). The descent reaches the floor at 0.26 m/s and
# the sensor goes invalid while the craft is still moving (its reading lags the truth: 0.085 m reported at a truth
# height of 0.038 m), so `on_ground_` (two valid readings below 5 cm) is never set, the estimator is not pinned to the
# ground, the stalled-descent test (`|vz| < 0.05 m/s`) never holds, and the 3 G impact cut does not fire either (this
# contact is below 3 G). Without the dead-zone touchdown LANDING would never end (backlog #24). The dead-zone touchdown
# (TakeoffLandingMgr::deadZoneTouchdown(), detailed_design.md §3 note 7) ends it: during the LANDING descent, a valid reading at or
# below 0.10 m followed by ONLY invalid samples for 0.2 s means the craft is on the floor. Here the last valid reading is
# 0.085 m and "Landing detected (ToF dead zone ...)" comes 0.2 s after it, with the craft at rest on the floor (truth
# height 0.021 m, vertical speed 0.001 m/s); LANDING -> IDLE_GROUND follows at once. The real log (front_tof_poshold_yaw360,
# 0.28 m/s) went invalid for good after valid readings of 0.039 and 0.031 m; replaying it, the rule does not fire during the
# descent and fires 0.23 s after the last valid reading (detailed_design.md §3 note 7).
#
# alt_disarm_land.scn に ToF の近距離の不感帯を加えたもの（どの実行でも既定。実機のセンサは約 3 cm より近いと
# 「目標なし」を返すので、床の上では無効）。降下は 0.26 m/s で床に着き、機体がまだ動いている間にセンサが無効になる
# （読みは真値に遅れる: 真の高さ 0.038 m で 0.085 m と報告）。そのため `on_ground_`（5 cm 未満の有効な読み 2 回）は立たず、
# 推定器は地面に固定されず、降下停滞の判定（`|vz| < 0.05 m/s`）は成り立たず、3 G の衝撃カットも働かない（この接触は
# 3 G 未満）。この経路が無いと LANDING は終わらない（バックログ #24）。不感帯での接地（
# TakeoffLandingMgr::deadZoneTouchdown()、detailed_design.md §3 注7）が終わらせる: LANDING の降下中に、0.10 m 以下の有効な
# 読みの後、無効サンプルだけが 0.2 s 続いたら、機体は床の上にある。ここでは最後の有効な読みが 0.085 m で、その 0.2 s 後に
# 「Landing detected (ToF dead zone ...)」が出る。機体は床の上で静止（真の高さ 0.021 m、鉛直速度 0.001 m/s）。続けて
# LANDING → IDLE_GROUND。実機ログ（front_tof_poshold_yaw360、0.28 m/s）は 0.039 m と 0.031 m の有効な読みの後、ずっと
# 無効になった。それを再生すると、この規則は降下中には作動せず、最後の有効な読みの 0.23 s 後に作動する
# （detailed_design.md §3 注7）。
#
# Run: sf sils scenario simulator/sils/scenarios/landing_dead_zone.scn --target vehicle
#
#  <t>  ch  <thr> <roll> <pitch> <yaw> <arm> <hold_ms> <rate_hz> <alt> <acro> <pos>
   0    rc   2048  2048   2048    2048  0     6000      50                       # A: boot at rest — still calibration completes (~4 s)
   +    rc   2048  2048   2048    2048  0     1500      50        1              # B: ALT switch ON while DISARMED → ground mode change
   +    rc   2048  2048   2048    2048  1     1000      50        1              # C: ARM in ALT_HOLD (press) — props stop, spool, AUTO-takeoff fires
   +    rc   2048  2048   2048    2048  1     4000      50        1              # D: throttle CENTER → climb to 0.5 m, reach Airborne, hover
   +    rc   2048  2048   2048    2048  0     500       50        1              # E: release the ARM button (so the next press is an edge)
   +    rc   2048  2048   2048    2048  1     6000      50        1              # F: press DISARM while FLYING → AUTO-LAND (gradual descent → touchdown → DISARM)
   +    rc   2048  2048   2048    2048  0     600       50                       # G: settle (disarmed after touchdown)
